content.text:
Now update ui to include upgrade and mute (mute button handled separately). Add `upgrade:document.getElementById('upgrade')`.

Update HUD line:
```js
ui.weapon.textContent=weapons[player.weapon].name;ui.objective.textContent=remaining?`LIMPE A CASA · ${player.kills}/5`:'RETORNE AO CARRO';
```
New:
```js
let tier=glockTiers[player.tier],nextTier=glockTiers[player.tier+1];
ui.weapon.textContent=tier.name;
ui.upgrade.textContent=nextTier?`PRÓX. UPGRADE ${Math.min(player.kills,nextTier.kills)}/${nextTier.kills}`:'MK IV · MÁXIMO';
ui.objective.textContent=remaining?`LIMPE A CASA · ${player.kills}/9`:'RETORNE AO CARRO';
```
Total dynamic = zombies.length. Use `${player.kills}/${zombies.length}`.

Also update stealth HUD:
```js
let hiddenStealth=player.stealth&&nearCover(player.x,player.z);
ui.stealth.textContent=player.stealth?(hiddenStealth?'FURTIVO · OCULTO':'FURTIVO · EXPOSTO'):'MODO NORMAL';
ui.stealth.classList.toggle('hidden',hiddenStealth);
```
And radio static gain.

DrawPlayer weapon block uses player.weapon; replace with tier attachments:
```js
// Glock with progression attachments
ctx.strokeStyle=..., lineWidth
begin pistol;
if(player.tier>=1) draw compensator small box at muzzle;
if(player.tier>=2) draw sight;
if(player.tier>=3) longer mag + selector.
```

Keyboard remove Digit lines; add M; swapBtn → reload. Add start audio init.

Also we need to ensure intro aside controls updated with M. Done.

Now audio code insertion. Place before reset() maybe after ui/player definitions. Use `audioDelay` global.

