But orientation: zombie screen x offset sway only; doesn't face. Fine — crawling horizontally regardless.

Add crawl animation with sin(z.walk) for arm reach. Since z.walk keeps increasing slowly when crawling (speed). Let's set walk increment.

Also blood trail from crawling: in updateZombies when crawling and moving: z.trail=(z.trail||0)+dt; if >.28 push blood {x:z.x,z:z.z,t:1}. And blood drawing with alpha fade based on t? blood shouldn't fade maybe. Let's have blood marks persistent with alpha .5 and size. Cap 120.

