and skip jump when crawling: condition `if(!z.crawling && zombieCollides(...))...`. Currently code does collision then if jump. If crawling, zombieCollides with jump false; if collides near low wall it sets jump and tries again — but jumping=true skips low wall, so crawling zombie could cross low wall. Need prevent: wrap the jump logic in `if(!z.crawling)`.

