```

Careful with poly and project.

planePts for side mapping. For 's' outward +z, for 'n' outward -z, 'w' outward -x, 'e' outward +x.

drawWindow:
```js
function drawWindow(o){
 let pts=planePts(o.side,o.x,o.z,o.w,1.18,2.52),inner=planePts(o.side,o.x,o.z,o.w-.22,1.3,2.4);
 poly(pts,'#1a1214');poly(inner,'#e0a267'); // warm glass
 // mullions
 let midX=o.x, midY=1.85;
 // helper point at plane
 ...
```
Need mapping for arbitrary u,v:
```js
function planePoint(side,x,z,halfW,y1,y2,u,v){ // u in [-1,1] across width, v in [0,1] height
 let y=y1+(y2-y1)*v, hw=halfW*u;
 if(side==='s')return [x+hw,y,z+.035];
 if(side==='n')return [x-hw,y,z-.035];
 if(side==='w')return [x-.035,y,z+hw];
 return [x+.035,y,z-hw];
}
```
Width full. Then inner quad computed with u=±.42 etc? Simpler use planePts.

For mullions: vertical line at u=0 from v=0..1; horizontal at v=.5. Use planePoint then project.

Broken: dark triangle in one pane: use planePoint with u [-.45,-.1], v [.55,.95] triangle, fill '#150f11'.

Also add a subtle outer glow? Fill warm.

drawGable:
```js
function drawGable(){
 if(player.z<13.35||Math.abs(player.x)>12)return;
 let y0=3.8,peak=5.6;
 poly([[-11.5,y0,13.02],[11.5,y0,13.02],[0,peak,13.02]],'#4b2e29');
 // tiles lines
 for(let i=1;i<6;i++){let t=i/6;let left=[-11.5+(11.5)*t,y0+(peak-y0)*t,13.02];let right=[11.5-(11.5)*t,y0+(peak-y0)*t,13.02];...line}
 // ridge/eave trim
 poly([[-11.5,y0,13.02],[11.5,y0,13.02],[11.5,y0+.3,13.02],[-11.5,y0+.3,13.02]],'#7a4d38');
 // chimney at x=-5.5 above slope
 poly([[-6.6,y0,12.98],[-4.4,y0,12.98],[-4.4,6.4,12.98],[-6.6,6.4,12.98]],'#3a2624');
 poly([[-4.4,y0,12.98],[-4.4,y0,13.4],[-4.4,6.4,13.4],[-4.4,6.4,12.98]],'#2a1b1c');
}
```
Chimney drawn at same plane; fine.

drawRug: quad on floor y=.03 with color and border stroke; add fringe lines maybe.

boxAt helper:
```js
function boxAt(x,z,w,d,h,col,side='#2a1f20',top='#7a5a44'){poly(floor rect,'rgba(0,0,0,.2)');poly(front, col);poly(sideface, side);poly(top,top)}
```
Use y=0..h.

drawRuin:
```js
function drawRuin(o){let {x,z,w,d,h}=o; boxAt(x,z,w,d,h,'#3b2b2a','#241a1c','#574136');
